# --concurrent false: two lint-staged entries write docs/spec/api.md —
# the permissions generator and `**/*.md` → `prettier --write`.
# lint-staged defaults to running every glob's commands at once, so a
# commit that stages both src/config/permissions.ts and api.md races
# them on one file and commits whichever write landed last. CI catches
# the stale block, but as a confusing red build rather than a clean
# commit.
npx lint-staged --concurrent false
